      "id": "story_1497_p0_c2",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "text": "この日付は普通でないので、好きではありません。",
      "text_en": "There were 366 days in 1992, not 365.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"きゅう\" data-defn=\"きゅう (word)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">この</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ひづけ\" data-defn=\"date/dating\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">日付</span><rt>ひづけ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"は\" data-defn=\"topic marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">は</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ふつう\" data-defn=\"normal/ordinary/regular/usual/common/average; normally/ordinarily/usually/generally/c\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">普通</span><rt>ふつう</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"で\" data-defn=\"location / means marker (at/in/by)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">で</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ない\" data-defn=\"not / non-existent\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">ない</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ので\" data-defn=\"ので (word)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">ので</span><rt></rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"すき\" data-defn=\"すき (word)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">好き</span><rt>すき</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"で\" data-defn=\"location / means marker (at/in/by)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">で</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"は\" data-defn=\"topic marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">は</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"あり\" data-defn=\"there is / to exist (stem)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">あり</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ません\" data-defn=\"verb polite suffix (negative: do not)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">ません</span><rt></rt></ruby>。",
      "start": 9.87,
      "end": 14.17,
      "duration": 4.3
    },
    {
      "id": "story_1497_p0_c3",
      "chunk_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "text": "1992年は366日あり、365日ではありませんでした。",
      "text_en": "The extra day was February 29.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"1992\" data-defn=\"1992年 (number / counter)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">1992年</span><rt>1992</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"は\" data-defn=\"topic marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">は</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"366\" data-defn=\"366日 (number / counter)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">366日</span><rt>366</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"あり\" data-defn=\"there is / to exist (stem)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">あり</span><rt></rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"365\" data-defn=\"365日 (number / counter)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">365日</span><rt>365</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"で\" data-defn=\"location / means marker (at/in/by)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">で</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"は\" data-defn=\"topic marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">は</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"あり\" data-defn=\"there is / to exist (stem)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">あり</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ません\" data-defn=\"verb polite suffix (negative: do not)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">ません</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"でした\" data-defn=\"was / were (past polite copula)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">でした</span><rt></rt></ruby>。",
      "start": 14.52,
      "end": 23.42,
      "duration": 8.9
    },
    {
      "id": "story_1497_p0_c4",
      "chunk_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "text": "余分の日は2月29日でした。",
      "text_en": "A year like that is called a “leap year.” Did you know that?",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"よぶん\" data-defn=\"extra/excess/surplus\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">余分</span><rt>よぶん</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"の\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (&#x27;s / of)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">の</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"にち\" data-defn=\"day / date\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">日</span><rt>にち</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"は\" data-defn=\"topic marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">は</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"2\" data-defn=\"2月 (number / counter)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">2月</span><rt>2</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"29\" data-defn=\"29日 (number / counter)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">29日</span><rt>29</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"でした\" data-defn=\"was / were (past polite copula)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">でした</span><rt></rt></ruby>。",
